37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: The all-in rate is a trap. It charges the light eater what the biggest appetite pays. I need a model where costs match actual consumption.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"The island house has one bathroom for everyone, and the water runs cold. That is a dealbreaker for me.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Takumi"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Takumi: The island house has one bathroom for everyone, and the water runs cold. That is a dealbreaker for me.""}]}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The shared house year was a failure. Whoever wanted an hour alone had nowhere to take it. I need a place that absorbs that need easily.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Rin, the island house is five thousand four hundred yen a head a night, plus food. That is the total before we even pack.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,The ferry takes two days. The train takes ninety minutes. I am not travelling for a week to sit on a boat.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, ninety minutes is acceptable. The ferry is not. I am glad we have that data to rule out the island.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, agreed. The ferry is a waste of time. I’m glad the train is quick, but I still need to know if the inn has a proper bathroom.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the shared house failed because there was no escape. A town with streets and a public bath absorbs that need easily.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, two days lost is unacceptable. The island is dead. I need to know if the city or the inn gives me a fixed number to trust.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train is ninety minutes. The ferry is a trap. I am done with the island.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the city bed is twelve to twenty thousand yen, but meals are extra. The inn is seventeen thousand with food included. I need to know which total is safer.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, the inn has fixed mealtimes and one room for everyone. That sounds like a cage. I need to know if the city gives me a door.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the city room has a door and no timetable. That is the escape I need. I am leaning toward the city.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, the city costs vary too much. The inn is a fixed number. I can trust a fixed number. I am voting for the inn.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,The train is ninety minutes. I am not sitting on a ferry. I am voting for the hot spring town.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the city’s variable costs are a liability. The inn’s fixed rate is the only model that prevents quiet debt. I am voting for the hot spring town.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,The inn forces me to eat at six and sleep on a futon. I need a door and my own space. I am voting for the city break.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Takumi"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Takumi: The inn forces me to eat at six and sleep on a futon. I need a door and my own space. I am voting for the city break.""}]}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The city room has a door and no timetable. That is the escape I need. I am voting for the city break.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
